    website: https://hoffresearch.com
abstract: >-
  Retrieval rig for the 3char dataset: measures chunk granularity, chunk form, key form and vector
  storage for short code tables on a fixed sample of ten systems and 51 verified questions, with two
  small embedders. Every number regenerates from the published Parquet with a fixed seed.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/brennercruvinel/3char-bench
keywords:
  - retrieval
  - chunking
  - embeddings
  - code systems
  - identifiers
  - evaluation
